{"title":"Career roadmap · Visual Designer","role":"Visual Designer","summary":"A Visual Designer creates visual systems and digital/physical communication assets that make brands, products and information clear, engaging and consistent. The role can span branding, UI visuals, marketing design, editorial design, motion graphics and design systems.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 of UG","Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Communication / Graphic Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Visual Designer creates visual systems and digital/physical communication assets that make brands, products and information clear, engaging and consistent. The role can span branding, UI visuals, marketing design, editorial design, motion graphics and design systems."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong direct alignment. Communication/Graphic Design provides the core foundation for typography, layout, colour, visual hierarchy, identity and communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Communication/Graphic Design","Design Internship","Junior Visual Designer","Visual Designer","Senior Visual Designer","Lead Visual Designer / Art Director","Design Director / Creative Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build visual fundamentals, software skills and a strong portfolio"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in branding, digital product, motion or visual systems"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead design systems, campaigns and multidisciplinary design teams"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress into art direction, design leadership, consulting or independent studio work"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table",